msgid "START_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"<b>👋 Zapomnim is a professional chat manager for Telegram</b>, "
"which works alongside your account <b>and does not require access to it</b>.\n"
"\n"
"🔒 We expand your capabilities and securely protect your conversations, "
"<b>keeping confidentiality and full control</b> exclusively with you.\n"
"\n"
"🔍 <b>Chat Manager Features</b>:\n"
"- Recovery of deleted messages.\n"
"- Tracking changes in chats.\n"
"- Protection against disappearing media files.\n"
"- Personalization for your business needs.\n"
"- Smart Voice-Messages transcription\n"
"- AI-powered chat analytics.\n\n"
"🧑‍💻 <b>Features in Development</b>:\n"
"- Reliability check for new contacts.\n"
"- Intelligent anti-fraud protection.\n"
"- Smart notifications.\n"
"- …and much more\n"
"\n"
"⚡️ <b>Smart. Convenient. Secure. We are Zapomnim.</b>"


