msgid "CONNECT_BUSINESS_BOT_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"<b>How to connect the Zapomnim bot:</b>\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to <b>Settings</b> → <b>Telegram Business</b>.\n"
"2. In the <b>Chat Bots</b> section, add our bot — "
"<code>@zapomnim_bot</code>.\n"
"3. Make sure to grant the bot full access to messages — this is required "
"for all features to work correctly.\n"
"\n"
"Done! Your chats is now under reliable protection and control."

msgid "CONNECT_BUSINESS_BOT_SUCCESS_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"✅ <b>The bot has been successfully connected!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Now, you can setup bot as you need."

msgid "BUSINESS_BOT_DISCONNECTED_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"⛔️ <b>The business bot has been disconnected.</b>\n"
"\n"
"To continue its operation, it needs to be reconnected."

msgid "SELECT_BOT_TYPE"
msgstr ""
"<b>Select Bot Operating Mode</b>\n"
"\n"
"Both modes are secure and protected by state-of-the-art encryption technologies. The main difference lies in the level of processing and available features.\n"
"\n"
"<b>🔓 Advanced Mode</b>\n"
"- Full access to all features\n"
"- Intelligent chat analysis\n"
"- Statistics and data export\n"
"- Retention of deleted and edited messages\n"
"\n"
"<b>🕵️ Private Mode</b>\n"
"- Maximum privacy level\n"
"- No information is shared with third parties\n"
"- AI analysis, statistics, and export are disabled\n"
"- Data recovery is not possible\n"
"\n"
"<b>Selected Mode: {selected_mode}</b>"

msgid "CONFIRM_STANDARD_BOT_TYPE"
msgstr "<b>🧑‍💻 You are about to switch to Standard Mode.</b>\n\n"
"After switching to this mode, you will have full access to all bot features."

msgid "CONFIRM_PRIVACY_BOT_TYPE"
msgstr "<b>🥷 You are about to switch to Private Mode.</b>\n\n"
"<b>Please note:</b>\n"
"- All your previous messages will also <b>be switched to Private Mode</b>.\n"
"- They will <b>never be processed</b> by us or any LLM again.\n"
"- It will <b>not be possible to restore or export them</b>.\n\n"
"Are you sure you want to switch to Private Mode?"

